# Synthetic 3-tier fat tree with link bundles at BOTH tier 1 (ToR<->Agg, bundle 2) and tier 2 (Agg<->Core, bundle 2).
# Used only by scripts/rc_random.sh (-routing_check_random bundle coverage). 32 hosts, 2 pods, 4 ToR + 2 Agg per pod, 8 cores.
Nodes 32
Tiers 3
Podsize 16

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 2

Tier 2
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 1000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 2
